---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="px-6 py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl text-center">
    <h1
      class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-balance text-neutral-950 sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl"
    >
      A real marketing plan. For your budget. In 15 minutes.
    </h1>

    <p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-prose text-lg text-neutral-600">
      Kampa interviews you like a strategist — your business, your budget, your
      hours — then builds a complete 90-day campaign: channel plan, weekly
      calendar, ready-to-paste copy. Free software. You pay Anthropic ~€1 per
      campaign.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <a
        href={base + "app"}
        class="bg-primary text-primary-foreground rounded-lg px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold hover:opacity-90"
      >
        Start a campaign →
      </a>
      <a
        href={base + "app?demo=1"}
        class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-neutral-950 hover:bg-neutral-50"
      >
        See a sample plan
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-neutral-500">
      No signup. No servers. Your data and API key never leave your browser.
    </p>

    <!-- Decorative mockup of a finished campaign package. -->
    <div
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-3xl rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-6 text-left shadow-sm"
    >
      <div
        class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-neutral-200 pb-4 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-950"
      >
        <span>90-day campaign — Riga coffee shop</span>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-5 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]">
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-neutral-600">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="bg-primary size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full"></span>
            Instagram · 3 posts/week
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="bg-primary size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full"></span>
            Google Business Profile · weekly
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="bg-primary size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full"></span>
            Email · bi-weekly
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 sm:flex-col sm:items-end">
          <span
            class="rounded-full border border-neutral-200 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-600"
          >
            +40 followers/mo
          </span>
          <span
            class="rounded-full border border-neutral-200 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-600"
          >
            ≤ 4 h/week
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-16 text-xs tracking-widest text-neutral-500 uppercase">
      BUILT FOR SMALL BUSINESSES THAT DO THEIR OWN MARKETING
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
